    <string name="steps_title">Setup</string>
    <string name="steps_body">1. Enable the service in Settings → Accessibility → OpenTouchpad.\n2. If Android blocks it ("restricted setting"), open App info → ⋮ → Allow restricted settings, then try again.\n3. Come back here and adjust the size, speed and buttons to fit the user.</string>

